{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/667874-seems-there-are-more-seemings","id":667874,"title":"Seems There Are More Seemings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-16T23:51:24-07:00","id":667874,"title":"Seems There Are More Seemings","content":"In the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-2/\" target=\"_blank\">most recent Kiths post</a>, Dave Hill recapped some <i>other</i> spoilers involving brand new Seemings!<br /> <br /> Apparently there will be a new one in the Dark Eras supplement.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> T<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">hat one\u2019s literally about embracing a story to escape, taking on a role from a tale in order to get the edge and flee Arcadia.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps these folks will be called something like Players? I bet they'll be similar to the Wizened in terms of Blessing/Curse revolving around the &quot;role&quot; they played in the tale.<br /> <br /> Dave also mentioned that you could look at this as the eighth Seeming. I feel fairly confident that he's referring to the Seemingless, but I could be wrong.<br /> <br /> Then we have the first supplement for CtL2e, entitled <b>The Hedge</b>, which will have one more...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">They escaped by embracing chance, chaos, and luck. They closed their eyes and jumped, putting their faith in the universe.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure if <b>The Hedge</b> is going to be a sort of players' guide, but I find this one really interesting. It kinda feels like their themes could faith, destiny, and providence. Do they feel they have a debt to repay? Are they still on their journey?<br /> <br /> I'd love to hear what you guys think, especially if you have more dirt from other postings!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","user":"Metamurpho","date":". 09-17-2015, 02:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T23:55:56-07:00","id":667898,"title":"","content":"The Dark Eras Seeming has been known to be Grimms for some weeks now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","ti